claim.claim-text:
a) characteristic of at least 80% of the collected spectra having a D/G area ratio below 0.5, for example, at least 95% of the collected spectra having a D/G area ratio below 0.5;
b) characteristic of at least 50% of the collected spectra having a D/G area ratio below 0.2, for example, at least 70% of the collected spectra having a D/G area ratio below 0.2; or
c) characteristic of at the average D/G area ratio being below 0.8, for example, below 0.5 or below 0.2.
